          <mi>C</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>ρ<!-- ρ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle C_{\rho }}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/3279333cefa351defa00fefaf47045780b1791c8" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:2.744ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle C_{\rho }}"/></span> the corresponding conjugacy classes. The values of the characters <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt71" id="mw5A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\chi_\\lambda(C_\\rho)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \chi _{\lambda }(C_{\rho })}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>χ<!-- χ --></mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>λ<!-- λ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>C</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>ρ<!-- ρ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \chi _{\lambda }(C_{\rho })}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b851f66334385499062d59b4767fbb482410d5c5" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:7.199ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \chi _{\lambda }(C_{\rho })}"/></span> can be computed using the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frobenius_formula" title="Frobenius formula" id="mw5Q">Frobenius formula</a>. The coefficients <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt72" id="mw5g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"z_\\rho"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle z_{\rho }}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>z</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>ρ<!-- ρ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle z_{\rho }}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b8607fb7e82ec135a357d0bbb297b5d492f7c692" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:2.163ex; height:2.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle z_{\rho }}"/></span> are</p>
<dl id="mw5w"><dd id="mw6A"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt73" id="mw6Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\nz_\\rho = \\prod_{j=0}^n j^{i_j}i_j! = \\frac{n!}{|C_\\rho|}\n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle z_{\rho }=\prod _{j=0}^{n}j^{i_{j}}i_{j}!={\frac {n!}{|C_{\rho }|}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>z</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>ρ<!-- ρ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <munderover>
          <mo>∏<!-- ∏ --></mo>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>j</mi>
            <mo>=</mo>
            <mn>0</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </munderover>
        <msup>
          <mi>j</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <msub>
              <mi>i</mi>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mi>j</mi>
              </mrow>
            </msub>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <msub>
          <mi>i</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>j</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>!</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mfrac>
            <mrow>
              <mi>n</mi>
              <mo>!</mo>
            </mrow>
            <mrow>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mo stretchy="false">|</mo>
              </mrow>
              <msub>
                <mi>C</mi>
                <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                  <mi>ρ<!-- ρ --></mi>
                </mrow>
              </msub>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mo stretchy="false">|</mo>
              </mrow>
            </mrow>
          </mfrac>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle z_{\rho }=\prod _{j=0}^{n}j^{i_{j}}i_{j}!={\frac {n!}{|C_{\rho }|}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/cd137a1fcb89eeacc554ded6f4a06912b27e942c" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -3.338ex; width:21.422ex; height:7.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle z_{\rho }=\prod _{j=0}^{n}j^{i_{j}}i_{j}!={\frac {n!}{|C_{\rho }|}}}"/></span></dd></dl>
<p id="mw6g">where <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt74" id="mw6w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"i_j"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle i_{j}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>i</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>j</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle i_{j}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/70a1a26ae2490839d7917cfabc4f6c8c62d9fb04" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:1.712ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle i_{j}}"/></span> is the number of times <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt75" id="mw7A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"j"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle j}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>j</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle j}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/2f461e54f5c093e92a55547b9764291390f0b5d0" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; margin-left: -0.027ex; width:0.985ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle j}"/></span> appears in <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt76" id="mw7Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\rho"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \rho }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>ρ<!-- ρ --></mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \rho }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/1f7d439671d1289b6a816e6af7a304be40608d64" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:1.202ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \rho }"/></span>, so that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt77" id="mw7g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\sum i_jj = n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \sum i_{j}j=n}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo>∑<!-- ∑ --></mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>i</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>j</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mi>j</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>n</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \sum i_{j}j=n}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/992591b4852f9292dc348511c4f20f9ff4ab82fc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.338ex; width:10.905ex; height:3.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \sum i_{j}j=n}"/></span>.</p>

<p id="mw7w">A few examples, written in terms of Young diagrams <span about="#mwt78" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw8A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"harv","href":"./Template:Harv"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Hamermesh"},"2":{"wt":"1989"}},"i":0}}]}'>(</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFHamermesh1989" about="#mwt78" class="mw-selflink-fragment">Hamermesh 1989</a><span about="#mwt78">)</span>:</p>
