<p id="mwAQc">where the depth <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt92" id="mwAQg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"d_\\lambda=n-\\lambda_1"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle d_{\lambda }=n-\lambda _{1}}">
