</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f7dbad10cbbed12d0ee92be11b8694a2c002f9cc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:6.903ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle n\geq \lambda _{1}}"/></span>, <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt95" id="mwAQ0" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\lambda[n]=(n-|\\lambda|,\\lambda)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \lambda [n]=(n-|\lambda |,\lambda )}">
