            <mo>,</mo>
            <mi>μ<!-- μ --></mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
            <mi>n</mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
            <mo>,</mo>
            <mi>ν<!-- ν --></mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
            <mi>n</mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\bar {C}}_{\lambda ,\mu ,\nu }=\lim _{n\to \infty }C_{\lambda [n],\mu [n],\nu [n]}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/1b485d7e462f6ae4bafe121d88ccca3b51cce68c" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.838ex; width:24.825ex; height:4.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\bar {C}}_{\lambda ,\mu ,\nu }=\lim _{n\to \infty }C_{\lambda [n],\mu [n],\nu [n]}}"/></span></dd></dl>
<p id="mwARQ">is called a <b id="mwARU">reduced Kronecker coefficient</b><sup about="#mwt100" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-bor09_7-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"bor09"}}'><a href="#cite_note-bor09-7" id="mwARY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwARc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwARg">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwARk">]</span></span></a></sup> or <b id="mwARo">stable Kronecker coefficient</b>.<sup about="#mwt101" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-as18_8-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"as18"}}'><a href="#cite_note-as18-8" id="mwARs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwARw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAR0">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAR4">]</span></span></a></sup> There are known bounds on the value of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt102" id="mwAR8" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle n}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>n</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle n}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a601995d55609f2d9f5e233e36fbe9ea26011b3b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.395ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle n}"/></span> where <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt103" id="mwASA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"C_{\\lambda[n],\\mu[n],\\nu[n]}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle C_{\lambda [n],\mu [n],\nu [n]}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>C</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>λ<!-- λ --></mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
