            <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
            <mo>,</mo>
            <mi>μ<!-- μ --></mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
            <mi>n</mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
            <mo>,</mo>
            <mi>ν<!-- ν --></mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
            <mi>n</mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle C_{\lambda [n],\mu [n],\nu [n]}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c27faef6ed3167f6a7cbe517ea6b2e2e2fbe0375" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.171ex; width:11.332ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle C_{\lambda [n],\mu [n],\nu [n]}}"/></span> reaches its limit.<sup about="#mwt104" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-bor09_7-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"bor09"}}'><a href="#cite_note-bor09-7" id="mwASE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwASI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwASM">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwASQ">]</span></span></a></sup> The reduced Kronecker coefficients are structure constants of Deligne categories of representations of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt105" id="mwASU" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{n}}">
