</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e209f51c322b96fe8a904c4cecc34d4a350c7d99" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:5.734ex; height:3.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\bar {C}}_{\lambda ,\mu ,\nu }}"/></span> coincides with the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littlewood-Richardson_coefficient" title="Littlewood-Richardson coefficient" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAS4">Littlewood-Richardson coefficient</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt110" id="mwAS8" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"c_{\\lambda,\\mu}^\\nu"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle c_{\lambda ,\mu }^{\nu }}">
