</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/79ca3e11fc2d354e0a26eb23ae1a5718105516e4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.338ex; width:4.125ex; height:3.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle c_{\alpha \beta \gamma }^{\lambda }}"/></span>  via Littlewood's formula<sup about="#mwt114" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-lit58_11-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"lit58"}}'><a href="#cite_note-lit58-11" id="mwATk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwATo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwATs">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwATw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt115" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-oz17_12-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"oz17"}}'><a href="#cite_note-oz17-12" id="mwAT0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAT4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAT8">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAUA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<dl id="mwAUE"><dd id="mwAUI"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt116" id="mwAUM" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\n\\bar{C}_{\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu} = \\sum_{\\lambda&apos;,\\mu&apos;,\\nu&apos;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma} C_{\\lambda&apos;,\\mu&apos;,\\nu&apos;} c^{\\lambda}_{\\lambda&apos;\\beta\\gamma} c^{\\mu}_{\\mu&apos;\\alpha\\gamma} c^\\nu_{\\nu&apos;\\alpha\\beta}\n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\bar {C}}_{\lambda ,\mu ,\nu }=\sum _{\lambda ',\mu ',\nu ',\alpha ,\beta ,\gamma }C_{\lambda ',\mu ',\nu '}c_{\lambda '\beta \gamma }^{\lambda }c_{\mu '\alpha \gamma }^{\mu }c_{\nu '\alpha \beta }^{\nu }}">
