    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\text{ind}}_{\mu }(T)=\sum _{k\in \{{\text{descents}}(T)\}}b_{\mu }(k){\bmod {m}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e75aced0ffb99f10c249acbc483be74097a78d99" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -3.505ex; width:36.336ex; height:6.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\text{ind}}_{\mu }(T)=\sum _{k\in \{{\text{descents}}(T)\}}b_{\mu }(k){\bmod {m}}}"/></span>.
Then the cyclic exponents of the representation of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt134" id="mwAWw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{n}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S_{n}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9f049ac28d4ac8097b625f9d71c1f22b2ebd1bc4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.643ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{n}}"/></span> described by the Young diagram <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt135" id="mwAW0" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\lambda"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \lambda }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>λ<!-- λ --></mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \lambda }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b43d0ea3c9c025af1be9128e62a18fa74bedda2a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.355ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \lambda }"/></span> are the <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt136" id="mwAW4" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mu"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mu }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>μ<!-- μ --></mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \mu }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9fd47b2a39f7a7856952afec1f1db72c67af6161" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:1.402ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mu }"/></span>-indices of the corresponding Young tableaux.<sup about="#mwt137" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ste89_15-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ste89"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ste89-15" id="mwAW8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAXA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXE">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXI">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwAXM">In particular, if <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt138" id="mwAXQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":" w "}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle w}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>w</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle w}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/88b1e0c8e1be5ebe69d18a8010676fa42d7961e6" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.664ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle w}"/></span> is of order <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt139" id="mwAXU" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle n}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>n</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle n}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a601995d55609f2d9f5e233e36fbe9ea26011b3b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.395ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle n}"/></span>, then <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt140" id="mwAXY" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"b_\\mu(k)=k"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle b_{\mu }(k)=k}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>b</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>μ<!-- μ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>k</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>k</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle b_{\mu }(k)=k}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/83ae778b947e1d091a5b69424a43db45ddbd52c0" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:9.551ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle b_{\mu }(k)=k}"/></span>, and <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt141" id="mwAXc" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\text{ind}_\\mu(T)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\text{ind}}_{\mu }(T)}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mtext>ind</mtext>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>μ<!-- μ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>T</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\text{ind}}_{\mu }(T)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/bdd7852101e6d4931689dc73a603b9a14b097f35" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:7.901ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\text{ind}}_{\mu }(T)}"/></span> coincides with the major index of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt142" id="mwAXg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"T"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle T}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>T</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle T}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ec7200acd984a1d3a3d7dc455e262fbe54f7f6e0" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.636ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle T}"/></span> (the sum of the descents). The cyclic exponents of an irreducible representation of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt143" id="mwAXk" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{n}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S_{n}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9f049ac28d4ac8097b625f9d71c1f22b2ebd1bc4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.643ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{n}}"/></span> then describe <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Restricted_representation" title="Restricted representation" id="mwAXo">how it decomposes</a> into representations of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyclic_group" title="Cyclic group" id="mwAXs">cyclic group</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt144" id="mwAXw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":" \\frac{\\mathbb{Z}}{n\\mathbb{Z}}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\frac {\mathbb {Z} }{n\mathbb {Z} }}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mfrac>
            <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
              <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
            </mrow>
            <mrow>
              <mi>n</mi>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
              </mrow>
            </mrow>
          </mfrac>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\frac {\mathbb {Z} }{n\mathbb {Z} }}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/fe4b0ccc0da74c734603aa56d4651591369c6fb3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.838ex; width:3.781ex; height:5.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\frac {\mathbb {Z} }{n\mathbb {Z} }}}"/></span>, with <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt145" id="mwAX0" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\omega^{e_j}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \omega ^{e_{j}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mi>ω<!-- ω --></mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <msub>
              <mi>e</mi>
